{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "e2a9c4d1-8f3b-4c7e-9d2a-5b6c7d8e9f0a",
		"name": "ReimburseFlow API — Server",
		"description": "Complete API collection for the ReimburseFlow Express + MongoDB backend, pointing **directly** at the server (no Vite proxy).\n\n## Environments\n- `baseUrl` — default `http://localhost:5001/api` (server port from `server/.env`).\n\n## Auth Flow\n1. Run **Seed → Seed Demo Data** once (or start the server — it auto-seeds).\n2. Run **Auth → Login** or **Demo Login** — the token auto-saves into the `token` collection variable.\n3. Protected requests automatically send `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\n\n## Role Matrix\n| Route group | Employee | Manager | Admin |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Expenses (my/create/delete) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Expenses (company/export) | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Approvals (pending/process) | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Rules / Users / Budgets (write) | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |\n\n## Conventions\nAll responses follow `{ success, message?, count?, data }`.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5001/api" },
		{ "key": "token", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "email", "value": "admin@reimburseflow.com" },
		{ "key": "password", "value": "password123" }
	],
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
	},
